 calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, and in 2025 it came in at 33% of normal. That same year March to April ran 184% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 20239 had its driest year in 1963, at 48% of normal.</p>"}
